          "text": [
            "Fold 1: acc=0.9578 prec=0.9842 rec=0.9350 f1=0.9590\n",
            "Fold 2: acc=0.9370 prec=0.9840 rec=0.8981 f1=0.9391\n",
            "Fold 3: acc=0.9422 prec=0.9500 rec=0.9360 f1=0.9429\n",
